  "summary_en": "OECD country note on Finland's progress implementing the EU Coordinated Plan on AI, based on a 2024 survey and interviews. It describes Finland's Digital Compass, cloud-first and compute policies (LUMI, quantum), applied AI research and testbeds, skills programmes, and AI uptake in priority sectors, with an innovation-promotion focus and no robotics-specific governance content.",
